        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "over the death ofmy birdexplained what had happened.\"A mother mockingbird,finding her young in a cage, wil sometimes bring it poison berries.she thinks it bter for her young to de than to live in captivity.\"",
          "block_bbox": [
            205,
